  "title": "Transaction authorised only by two hash-x preimages of 0 and 64 bytes",
  "kind": "ledger",
  "caps": [],
  "caps_note": "Hash-x signers predate the CAP process (Protocol 3); the shape is a signature encoding, not a protocol change.",
