    "master-key-not-signing"
  ],
  "why": "For a hash-x signer the DecoratedSignature carries the preimage itself, here empty and 64 bytes long, with a hint taken from its sha256. Readers that expect every signature to be a 64-byte ed25519 signature reject the empty one or misattribute both.",
